        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•Immaculate two bedroom semi detached extending to approx. 78 sq.m/839 sq.ft\n•Accommodation comprises of hallway, guest w.c., kitchen/dining, living room, two bedrooms and family bathroom \n•The current owners have brought their own unique style to the property creating a warm and welcoming home with a bright colourful interior. The rear garden acts as an extended living space for relaxing and entertaining, complemented by a covered pergola and raised decking area with designated barbeque area\n•Ample off-street parking to the front, with a covered side entrance providing valuable additional storage, along with a garden shed and dedicated wood storage\n•Excellent transport links with the train station just a short walk, easy access to M4 leading to Dublin and all major road networks \n•A host of recreational amenities within Kilcock at one`s doorstep including schools, shops, restaurants and bars with Maynooth University Town is a short drive \n•The Royal Canal Greenway runs through the village centre, which is ideal for walkers, runners & cyclists of all ages\n\nGuide Price\n385,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Driveway\nPaved driveway, mature shrubs, covered side entrance to rear garden.\n\nEntrance Hallway 1.78m x 4.99m\nSemi-solid flooring, coving. \n\nGuest W.C. 0.77m x 1.44m\nSemi-solid flooring, w.c, w.h.b, extractor fan.\n\nKitchen /Dining 2.57m x 5.78m\nTiled floor, fully fitted kitchen, ceramic sink, double oven, gas hob, extractor, fitted shelving, decorative splashback tiles, feature bay window with built-in seating area and storage, spot lights.\n\nLiving Room 3.89m x 4.47m\nSemi-solid flooring, Stanley stove with stone surround and wooden mantle-piece, built-in shelving, coving.\n\nLanding 1.99m x 2.14m\nHot press, oak floor staircase to ground floor.\n\nMaster Bedroom 3.22m x 4.24m\nSemi-solid flooring, fitted wardrobes, decorative curtains and blinds, door to bathroom.\n\nBathroom 2.16m x 2.58m\nTiled floor, bath, w.c, w.h.b. with vanity cabinet, mirror.\n\nBedroom 2 2.99m x 4.45m\nSemi-solid flooring, slide-robes, blinds, door to bathroom.\n\nGarden \nRaised decking area & cover pergola seating area for entertaining friends and family with barbeque area, lawn, mature shrubs, stone paving to garden shed, wood storage unit, walled surround.\n\nCovered Side Lean-To 6.50m x 1.80m\nAdditional storage, power point and plumbed (ready to be connected).\n\nAdditional Information:\nPartly floored attic done in 2017\nBuilt in 2002\nAdditional storage\n\nItems Included in sale:\nDouble oven, gas hob, extractor and blinds.\n\nServices\nMains water\nGas fired central heating\n\nBER \nC1\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W23 K037\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nJill Wright\n016286128\n"
